# --- funnel design capture ----------------------------------------------------
# Screenshots are regenerable with `node capture/shots.js` / `walk_visual.js` and there is no
# lane in which they are diffed (the simple.life pass is a *reference* build, so there is no
# pixel target to regress against), which makes 22MB of them poor repository material. The
# measurements they were taken from stay tracked: `capture/*.json`, `capture/**/boxes-*.json`
# and `capture/plan.md` are the pattern brief, and the geometry tables in it are the thing a
# later change is checked against.
#
# It also keeps the reference's own artwork (their brand, their photography) out of the tree,
# which is the rights posture a reference build is supposed to leave behind.
funnel_app/capture/**/*.png

